        <mxCell id="rt-finalization-note" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Finalization sequence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;4  Verify image signature&lt;br&gt;5  Submit Batch job (waits for slot)&lt;br&gt;6  Batch launches Fargate&lt;br&gt;7  Container requests RUNNING&lt;br&gt;8  Read input; prove; store artifacts&lt;br&gt;9  Batch releases slot after exit&lt;br&gt;10  Validate artifacts; persist&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rejected startup → no input read&lt;br&gt;or proof execution." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#5A6B7B;spacing=0;">
